OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry and clear. Then the rest   
OL,7,Fof the night will be dry with lengthy  
OL,8,Fclear periods and a widespread sharp   
OL,9,Ffrost.                                 
OL,11,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start all     
OL,12,Fparts will have a dry, cold and sunny  
OL,13,Fday. Mostly light winds but breezy     
OL,14,Fover Kintyre and the Argyll Isles.     
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and 
OL,17,Fsunny on Sunday, overnight frost. Dry  
OL,18,Ffor most of Monday but rain likely to  
OL,19,Fspread from the west Monday night and  
OL,20,Flinger on Tuesday.                     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
